landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"881cc4d\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"2\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjUwMiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2hkbWFyaW5lLmNvbS50clwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTBcLzIuanBnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiODgxY2M0ZCJ9\" href='https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/2.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/2-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/2-150x150.jpg 150w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/2-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"881cc4d\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"3\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MjUwMywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2hkbWFyaW5lLmNvbS50clwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMTBcLzMuanBnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiODgxY2M0ZCJ9\" href='https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/3.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/3-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/3-150x150.jpg 150w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/3-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</div></figure>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-55d6687 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"55d6687\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Lobe pompa (rotary lobe pump)</strong>, loblu rotorlardan oluşan pozitif deplasmanlı bir pompa türüdür. Bu yapısı sayesinde <strong>düşük kesme, yüksek verim ve hassas akış kontrolü</strong> sağlar. Sine-lob pompalar özellikle <strong>viskoz sıvıları, parçacıklı akışkanları ve hassas ürünleri</strong> problemsiz bir şekilde taşımak için ideal çözümdür.</p><p>HD Marine sine-lob pompalar, dayanıklı gövde yapısı ve üstün performansı ile endüstriyel tesislerde, marin uygulamalarda ve üretim hatlarında <strong>kesintisiz sıvı transferi</strong> sunar.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cf80fe8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cf80fe8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0dd8a20 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"0dd8a20\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSine Lob Pompa Teknik Değer Tablosu\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dfa8333 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dfa8333\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"514\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"185\">Özellik</td><td width=\"329\">Değer</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Pompa Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Rotary Lobe (Sine-Lob)</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Debi Aralığı</td><td width=\"329\">1 – 400 m³/h</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Maksimum Basınç</td><td width=\"329\">12 – 20 bar</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Viskozite Uyumu</td><td width=\"329\">1 – 1.000.000 cP</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Motor Gücü</td><td width=\"329\">0.55 – 22 kW</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Gövde Malzemesi</td><td width=\"329\">Paslanmaz Çelik</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Bağlantı Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Flanşlı / Dişli</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Çalışma Sıcaklığı</td><td width=\"329\">-10°C / +150°C</td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-02dac87 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"02dac87\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"313\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/lob-pompa.gif\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2532\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-22f740d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"22f740d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=